        IF `the bill sets out the amount of goods and services tax payable`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The bill of costs must also set out the amount of goods and services tax (GST) payable on the costs claimed"

